				<SPAN class=MainHeading style="display:inline;width:460px; height:21px">Help Desk</SPAN><SPAN class=Copyright style="padding-top:6px;padding-right:25px;display:inline;width:110px;HEIGHT:21px;cursor:hand;BACKGROUND-IMAGE:url('Images/PrintArrow.gif')" onclick="window.print()">Print this page</SPAN>
				
				<P>Welcome to the Oxiana IT Helpdesk Intranet.</P>

				<P>The Helpdesk performs an important roll in the IT Support process. Some of the advantages of logging your IT related issues with us include:</P>
				<UL>
				<LI>A consistent and reliable avenue for you to log and track your IT related issues.</LI>
				<LI>When your call is logged you will be assigned a reference number that you can use to track the progress of your call at any time.</LI>
				<LI>Incidents that cannot be resolved immediately by the Helpdesk can be escalated quickly to the relevant group who can then prioritise and resolve your call in the most efficient manner.</LI>
				<LI>Even if the person actively working on your call is not currently available you can get an up to date progress report by calling the Helpdesk.</LI>
				<LI>It helps us to help you! If we can reference old calls that have the same or similar problems to yours its much faster for us to find the solution and get you working again.</LI>
				</UL>
				<P align=center><U>I would encourage you to use the Helpdesk rather then going directly to your local support personnel to log all of your IT related issues wherever possible.</U></P>


